{"kind":"stack","id":"s-light","title":"Light and seeing: what do we need to see things?","theme":{"background":"#fdf8e8","foreground":"#222222","font":"Arial, sans-serif"}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c1","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c1-q","content":"What do we need in order to see things?"},{"type":"button","id":"c1-a","label":"Light","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"sound","sound":"cheer"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c2"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c1-b","label":"Sound","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c2"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c1-c","label":"Heat","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c2"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c2","kind":"flash","elements":[{"type":"image","picto":"bulb"},{"type":"text","id":"c2-t","content":"Light"},{"type":"text","id":"c2-e","content":"Light is energy that travels from a source, such as the sun or a lamp, so that we can see things."},{"type":"button","id":"c2-next","label":"Next Card","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c3"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c3","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c3-q","content":"What is dark?"},{"type":"button","id":"c3-a","label":"The absence of light","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"sound","sound":"cheer"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c4"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c3-b","label":"A colour that is painted on objects","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c4"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c3-c","label":"A kind of very cold air","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c4"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c4","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c4-q","content":"Why can we not see our desk in a room with no light?"},{"type":"button","id":"c4-a","label":"Because there is no light to reach our eyes from the desk","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"sound","sound":"cheer"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c5"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c4-b","label":"Because the desk becomes too heavy to lift","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c5"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c4-c","label":"Because our eyes stop working in any room","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c5"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c5","kind":"story","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c5-t","content":"You wake in the night and the room is completely dark. Do you turn on the torch or wait for your eyes to adjust?"},{"type":"button","id":"c5-a","label":"Turn on the torch","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c6"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c5-b","label":"Wait for your eyes to adjust","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c7"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c6","kind":"story","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c6-t","content":"The torch lights up the room, so you can see your shoes and find the door. Light from the torch reached your eyes."},{"type":"button","id":"c6-next","label":"Continue","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c8"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c7","kind":"story","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c7-t","content":"Your eyes take a while to adjust, but you still see only faint shapes. Without light, you cannot see clearly."},{"type":"button","id":"c7-next","label":"Continue","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c8"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c8","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c8-q","content":"Which of these gives out its own light?"},{"type":"button","id":"c8-a","label":"The sun","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"sound","sound":"cheer"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c9"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c8-b","label":"The moon","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c9"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c8-c","label":"A chair","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c9"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c9","kind":"flash","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c9-t","content":"Dark"},{"type":"text","id":"c9-e","content":"Dark is what we notice when there is no light. It is not a thing; it is simply the absence of light."},{"type":"button","id":"c9-next","label":"Next Card","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c10"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c10","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c10-q","content":"When a torch is switched off in a dark room, what happens?"},{"type":"button","id":"c10-a","label":"The room becomes dark because no light is reaching our eyes","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"sound","sound":"cheer"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c11"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c10-b","label":"The room becomes dark because the walls take in the dark","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c11"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c10-c","label":"The room stays bright for an hour","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c11"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c11","kind":"end","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c11-h","content":"Well done: you know what light and dark are!"},{"type":"text","id":"c11-m","content":"You now know that we need light to see things, and that dark is the absence of light. Keep looking closely at the world around you."}],"actions":[]}}
